---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import ContextualCTA from '../components/ContextualCTA.astro';
import { media } from '../data/media';
---
<BaseLayout title="Life at Amus | Amus College School" description="Explore boarding school life, activities and community at Amus College School in Bukedea District, Uganda." canonical="/life-at-amus">
  <SiteHeader />
  <main id="main-content">
    <PageIntro label="Life at Amus" title="A shared life beyond the classroom." intro="At Amus College School, boarding brings learning, friendship and participation into the everyday rhythm of school." />
    <section class="life-boarding section" id="boarding"><div class="wrap life-boarding-grid"><div><h2>Boarding is part of the everyday story.</h2><p>Amus College is a boarding school. Shared routines, friendships, study and participation shape the everyday experience of students.</p><p>Across the day, students come together for learning, meals, reflection and the activities that make a school community feel lived-in.</p></div><figure><Image src={media.boarding.src} widths={[640, 960, 1384]} sizes="(max-width: 820px) 100vw, 58vw" alt={media.boarding.alt} loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" /></figure></div></section>
    <section class="life-rhythm section"><div class="wrap life-rhythm-grid"><figure><Image src={media.lifeCommunity.src} widths={[480, 760, 1080]} sizes="(max-width: 820px) 100vw, 42vw" alt={media.lifeCommunity.alt} loading="lazy" /></figure><div><h2>Shared daily life.</h2><p>School life is made in the smaller moments as much as in formal lessons: time with peers, focused study and the practical habits of a boarding community.</p><p class="life-caption">A community where students live, learn and participate together.</p></div></div></section>
    <section class="life-faith section"><div class="wrap life-faith-grid"><div><h2>Faith and community.</h2><p>Moments of prayer, celebration and reflection are part of the community life represented at Amus. They sit alongside the shared experiences that bring students together.</p></div><figure><Image src={media.lifePrayer.src} widths={[560, 900, 1200]} sizes="(max-width: 820px) 100vw, 55vw" alt={media.lifePrayer.alt} loading="lazy" /></figure></div></section>
    <section class="life-creative section" id="activities"><div class="wrap"><div class="life-creative-heading"><h2>Making space for expression.</h2><p>Music, dance and drama offer ways to create, contribute and take part in the life of the school.</p></div><figure class="life-creative-image"><Image src={media.beyond.src} widths={[720, 1100, 1500]} sizes="100vw" alt={media.beyond.alt} loading="lazy" /></figure></div></section>
    <section class="life-participation section"><div class="wrap life-participation-grid"><div><h2>Expression, service and responsibility.</h2><p>Debate gives students space for ideas and attentive listening. Scouting brings teamwork, service and practical responsibility into the wider experience of school.</p></div><div class="life-participation-images"><figure><Image src={media.debate.src} widths={[420, 680, 960]} sizes="(max-width: 820px) 100vw, 34vw" alt={media.debate.alt} loading="lazy" /></figure><figure><Image src={media.scouting.src} widths={[420, 680, 960]} sizes="(max-width: 820px) 100vw, 34vw" alt={media.scouting.alt} loading="lazy" /></figure></div></div></section>
    <ContextualCTA title="See what life at Amus can feel like." copy="Talk with the school about boarding life, learning and the next step for your family." primaryLabel="Contact Amus" primaryHref="/contact" secondaryLabel="Explore learning" secondaryHref="/learning" />
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
</BaseLayout>
